1
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:03,430
Honey Bunny Kidz presents:

2
00:00:03,430 --> 00:00:06,075
Ollie Owl Helps Find Mimi's Bell!

3
00:00:06,425 --> 00:00:09,100
A cosy bedtime story.

4
00:00:11,950 --> 00:00:13,458
The sun went down,

5
00:00:13,458 --> 00:00:15,325
and the stars came out.

6
00:00:15,675 --> 00:00:19,350
Mimi Kitten had played with Honey all afternoon.

7
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:23,900
Now Mama Bunny was walking Mimi home for bed.

8
00:00:24,650 --> 00:00:27,393
Oh! My collar is so quiet.

9
00:00:27,743 --> 00:00:30,088
Where is my little bell?

10
00:00:30,838 --> 00:00:33,363
Your jingly bell is gone?

11
00:00:34,113 --> 00:00:37,034
Yes. I feel a little worried.

12
00:00:37,384 --> 00:00:39,663
I love my bell.

13
00:00:40,413 --> 00:00:43,313
It's okay to feel worried, Mimi.

14
00:00:43,663 --> 00:00:45,309
When we need help,

15
00:00:45,309 --> 00:00:47,113
we can ask a friend.

16
00:00:47,863 --> 00:00:50,613
Who has the best ears at night?

17
00:00:50,963 --> 00:00:52,663
Can you guess?

18
00:00:54,663 --> 00:00:55,577
Ollie Owl!

19
00:00:55,577 --> 00:00:58,463
Owls can hear tiny sounds in the dark.

20
00:01:01,113 --> 00:01:03,270
Hoo-hoo! Hello, friends.

21
00:01:03,270 --> 00:01:05,188
Did somebody call me?

22
00:01:05,938 --> 00:01:07,807
Ollie, can you help me?

23
00:01:07,807 --> 00:01:09,676
My little bell is lost.

24
00:01:10,426 --> 00:01:12,411
Of course I can help.

25
00:01:12,411 --> 00:01:14,726
Owls have very good ears.

26
00:01:15,076 --> 00:01:18,526
Let's all be very quiet, and listen.

27
00:01:19,276 --> 00:01:21,651
Shh. Everyone listened.

28
00:01:22,451 --> 00:01:24,451
Chirp, chirp, chirp!

29
00:01:24,951 --> 00:01:26,648
Is that the jingle?

30
00:01:26,648 --> 00:01:28,576
What makes that sound?

31
00:01:30,576 --> 00:01:32,403
It's a little cricket!

32
00:01:32,403 --> 00:01:33,426
Not a bell.

33
00:01:36,076 --> 00:01:38,826
The little cricket sang in the grass.

34
00:01:39,176 --> 00:01:41,701
Then they heard another sound.

35
00:01:42,451 --> 00:01:44,451
Ribbit, ribbit!

36
00:01:44,951 --> 00:01:46,398
Who says ribbit?

37
00:01:46,398 --> 00:01:48,376
Can you say it with me?

38
00:01:50,376 --> 00:01:51,243
A frog!

39
00:01:51,243 --> 00:01:53,496
Ribbit! That was funny.

40
00:01:53,846 --> 00:01:56,457
But it is not my bell.

41
00:01:59,107 --> 00:02:00,610
Mimi, let's think.

42
00:02:00,610 --> 00:02:03,332
Where did you have your bell today?

43
00:02:04,082 --> 00:02:07,024
I had my bell at nap time.

44
00:02:07,374 --> 00:02:10,471
I curled up in my cosy bed.

45
00:02:11,221 --> 00:02:15,296
Hoo! Then let's go and listen by your cosy bed.

46
00:02:16,046 --> 00:02:17,780
We'll all go together.

47
00:02:17,780 --> 00:02:19,721
I'll walk you home, Mimi.

48
00:02:20,471 --> 00:02:24,610
So Mama Bunny walked Mimi and Honey to Mimi's cottage,

49
00:02:24,610 --> 00:02:27,296
and Ollie flew softly beside them.

50
00:02:29,946 --> 00:02:32,971
Mimi's room was warm and cosy.

51
00:02:33,321 --> 00:02:36,471
Her round bed had a soft pink cushion.

52
00:02:37,221 --> 00:02:41,021
Shh. Let's listen very, very carefully.

53
00:02:41,771 --> 00:02:43,865
I will pat my blanket.

54
00:02:43,865 --> 00:02:45,289
Pat, pat, pat.

55
00:02:46,039 --> 00:02:47,839
Jingle, jingle!

56
00:02:48,339 --> 00:02:49,937
Did you hear that?

57
00:02:49,937 --> 00:02:51,764
What made that sound?

58
00:02:53,764 --> 00:02:54,776
A jingle!

59
00:02:54,776 --> 00:02:56,464
It's Mimi's bell!

60
00:02:59,114 --> 00:03:00,246
There it was!

61
00:03:00,246 --> 00:03:04,564
The little bell was snuggled in Mimi's blanket, all along.

62
00:03:05,314 --> 00:03:06,145
My bell!

63
00:03:06,145 --> 00:03:08,787
It was in my bed the whole time!

64
00:03:09,537 --> 00:03:12,762
Hoo-hoo! We found it together.

65
00:03:13,512 --> 00:03:14,901
Thank you, Ollie.

66
00:03:14,901 --> 00:03:15,803
Thank you,

67
00:03:15,803 --> 00:03:17,052
Honey and Mama.

68
00:03:17,402 --> 00:03:20,212
I don't feel worried any more.

69
00:03:20,962 --> 00:03:22,756
When you feel worried,

70
00:03:22,756 --> 00:03:24,837
it's good to ask for help.

71
00:03:25,187 --> 00:03:27,612
Friends help each other.

72
00:03:30,262 --> 00:03:34,262
Mama Bunny put the bell back on Mimi's pink collar.

73
00:03:35,012 --> 00:03:36,012
Jingle!

74
00:03:36,512 --> 00:03:39,344
Now my collar sings again!

75
00:03:39,694 --> 00:03:40,675
But shh,

76
00:03:40,675 --> 00:03:42,459
it's sleepy time.

77
00:03:43,209 --> 00:03:44,170
Before bed,

78
00:03:44,170 --> 00:03:47,259
let's do a sleepy kitten stretch together.

79
00:03:48,009 --> 00:03:50,389
Can you stretch your arms up high,

80
00:03:50,389 --> 00:03:51,483
like a kitten?

81
00:03:53,483 --> 00:03:54,685
Now a big,

82
00:03:54,685 --> 00:03:56,536
slow kitten yawn.

83
00:03:56,886 --> 00:03:58,346
Aaah.

84
00:03:59,846 --> 00:04:01,596
Smell the flower.

85
00:04:01,596 --> 00:04:02,821
Breathe in.

86
00:04:04,621 --> 00:04:06,200
Blow the candle.

87
00:04:06,200 --> 00:04:07,446
Breathe out.

88
00:04:09,246 --> 00:04:10,461
One more time.

89
00:04:10,461 --> 00:04:11,462
Breathe in,

90
00:04:11,462 --> 00:04:12,821
and breathe out.

91
00:04:16,921 --> 00:04:19,331
Mimi curled up in her cosy bed,

92
00:04:19,331 --> 00:04:22,096
with her little bell safe and sound.

93
00:04:22,846 --> 00:04:24,575
Goodnight, Mimi.

94
00:04:24,575 --> 00:04:26,396
Goodnight, Ollie.

95
00:04:26,746 --> 00:04:29,546
Goodnight, little friends.

96
00:04:30,296 --> 00:04:33,021
Who helped Mimi find her bell?

97
00:04:33,371 --> 00:04:35,096
Can you remember?

98
00:04:37,096 --> 00:04:38,345
Her friends did!

99
00:04:38,345 --> 00:04:39,792
When you need help,

100
00:04:39,792 --> 00:04:41,371
you can ask a friend.

101
00:04:42,121 --> 00:04:44,959
Mama Bunny and Honey waved goodnight,

102
00:04:44,959 --> 00:04:46,946
and went home to bed too.

103
00:04:47,696 --> 00:04:51,796
Share with a friend and subscribe to Honey Bunny Kidz!

104
00:04:52,396 --> 00:04:55,571
Hoo-hoo! Goodnight, friends!

105
00:04:55,921 --> 00:04:59,246
See you next time on Honey Bunny Kidz!
